1
00:00:00,688 --> 00:00:04,728
(Sheldon:)Amy has a fondness
for the comic strip Marmaduke.

2
00:00:06,061 --> 00:00:08,871
(Leonard:)-And...?
-And I think I've got it.

3
00:00:08,963 --> 00:00:12,743
Consider: A family possesses a dog
that is so large

4
00:00:12,867 --> 00:00:16,477
(Sheldon:)and poorly disciplined,
he causes nothing but problems.

5
00:00:16,571 --> 00:00:17,981
Why do they keep him?!

6
00:00:20,442 --> 00:00:22,252
(Leonard:)Maybe they fell in love with him
as a puppy

7
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:23,980
(Leonard:)and didn't know how big
he was gonna be.

8
00:00:24,813 --> 00:00:25,983
(Leonard:)Of course.

9
00:00:26,915 --> 00:00:29,915
(Sheldon:)You know, why couldn't
she just like Ziggy? Yeah?

10
00:00:30,051 --> 00:00:32,431
(Sheldon:)That thing's riddled with plot holes.

11
00:00:33,788 --> 00:00:35,568
(Leonard:)Sorry, buddy.

12
00:00:35,657 --> 00:00:38,107
(Sheldon:)I think she's a fan of Garfield
as well.

13
00:00:38,159 --> 00:00:39,399
(CHUCKLES)

14
00:00:39,561 --> 00:00:41,841
(Sheldon:)Oh, darn it, now so am I.

15
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:45,740
I'll see you later. I got to go watch
a stupid football game with Penny.

16
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:49,010
(Sheldon:)Wait, hang on.
You've spent time with Amy.

17
00:00:49,137 --> 00:00:51,617
(Sheldon:)Can you think of anything
she's fond of

18
00:00:51,673 --> 00:00:54,483
(Sheldon:)that has a bunch of flaws
she hasn't noticed?

19
00:00:59,514 --> 00:01:06,024
I got to go.

